        ('/**\n     * Resets value across all RLongAdder instances \n     * within defined <code>timeout</code>.\n     * \n     * @param timeout for reset\n     * @param timeUnit for timeout\n     * \n     * @return void\n     */', '/**\n     * 重置所有 {@link RLongAdder} 实例的计数。\n     * 在指定 {@code timeout} 内完成。\n     * \n     * @param timeout 操作超时\n     * @param timeUnit 时间单位\n     * \n     * @return 无返回值\n     */'),
